
$SUB ADVAN3 TRANS4

$PK

TVCL = THETA(1)* ((CLCR/83)**THETA(2))*((age/35)**THETA(3))
CL=TVCL* EXP(ETA(1))

TVV1  = THETA(4)* ((bodyweight/70)**THETA(5))
V1=TVV1* EXP(ETA(2))

TVV2 = THETA(6)
V2=TVV2* EXP(ETA(3))

TVQ = THETA(7)
Q=TVQ* EXP(ETA(4))

S1=V1/1000


$THETA
14.60 FIX; THETA(1), typical CL 
0.62 FIX; THETA(2), CLCG effect on CL
-0.34 FIX; THETA(3), AGE effect on CL
10.80 FIX; THETA(4), typical V1
0.99 FIX; THETA(5), WT effect on V1
12.60 FIX; THETA(6), V2
18.60 FIX; THETA(7), Q Intercompartmental clearance
0.188 FIX; THETA(8), RUV proportional
469 FIX; THETA(9), RUV additive in ug/l (original: mg/l)


